    - target: {fileID: 387651210900453539, guid: 045d94b652ac71d4f9814ed5218eab0d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'OBJECTIVE


        Stop enemies from reaching the center. Moving hexes
        damage enemies. Base HP 0 means defeat.


        CONTROLS


        WASD
        - Move wizard

        1 / 2 / 3 - Select spell

        Hold Left Mouse
        on a hex - Charge

        Release when READY - Cast

        Release early
        / RMB / Esc - Cancel

        Charging locks movement

        Auto Aim -
        Player hex toward target hex

        R - Rotate in Manual mode

        Wheel
        - Camera zoom

        Camera follows player horizontally

        I - Toggle
        Guide

        Alt+R - Restart


        VALLEY DEMO


        Snow peaks
        / Rock ridges - Fixed walls

        Water - Lowered, blocked walls

        Purple
        + - Amplify / Cyan - - Absorb

        Dirt trails connect the central clearing'
